3. COMPLIANCE & SIGNOFF NOTE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Cadence Innovus verifyConnectivity verifies complete topological electrical
connectivity against the imported synthesized gate-level netlist. Full LVS
(Layout Versus Schematic) against an external Golden SPICE netlist was not
performed due to absence of an external signoff LVS tool suite.
